{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29028","headline":"将度故城湖阻风夜泊永阳戍 · 许浑","name":"将度故城湖阻风夜泊永阳戍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行尽青溪日已蹉，云容山影水嵯峨。\n楼前归客怨清梦，楼上美人凝夜歌。\n独树高高风势急，平湖渺渺月明多。\n终期一艇载樵去，来往使帆凌白波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}